#
# Fail-witness for the no-duplicate ban on MODEL-SERVING (charter Hard Rule 10,
# ex:saNoRemintModelServingTerms): a fixture that RE-MINTS gmeow:ModelArtifact as rdfs:isDefinedBy
# the preference slice — the AC7 no-duplication violation (Principle 16). Unioned with the module
# by the gmeow:saFailWitness teeth check, it makes the ∃-redeclared-term ASK HOLD, proving the
# mustNot ban has teeth. The module reuses model-serving terms by-reference only; it must never
# carry this triple.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

gmeow:ModelArtifact rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/preference> .
